      "writtenOn": "2022-03-18T10:31:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Checked that this is a no-op on S-, so not a problem for mainline release.\n\nThis seems very ad-hoc but I don\u0027t see another good way to fulfill the use-case (Jean also looked at the general idea in ag/16731866 I see).\n\nJean noted other concerns captured in go/rb-sandbox-uids (VPN APIs based on uids, network selection based on uids, DownloadManager/JobScheduler attribution, NetworkStats attribution and others), so there\u0027s a good number of other areas to fix - could you file and triage bugs for each of these ?\nAs discussed with Martijn, this feature \"will be used only be SDK developers, and there will be a well-documented release plan for them on what does and doesn\u0027t work\" - so maybe everything doesn\u0027t need to be covered right away.\n\nI think it would be good to investigate some ways to simplify this too - having 2 rules per app when this mode isn\u0027t used most of the time is a bit unfortunate.",
      "revId": "3f01be04071f2486ec50dd888384f2b483e6ef7c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
